A Silent Camera that is truly usable and discreet!

It is perfect for taking discrete photos while you are at the theater, and still seeing what are you shooting at.

- capture images and videos without disturbing the audience.
- the preview image can be smaller than screen or larger;
- take photos discreetly while appearing to be reading news;
- full screen and small box preview of the video
- It has 15 preview screens:

* perfect black screen page;
* Facebook, Amazon and Yahoo style page;
* football game page,
* small box;
* vignette mode.
